        "ha" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shawara: 0 yana bincika dukkan tarihin sarƙa. Wannan shi ne zaɓi mafi aminci idan ba ka tabbata ba, amma yana iya ɗaukar tsawon lokaci wajen daidaitawa."
